{"id":384104006,"author":{"login":"sisp","id":2206639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDY2Mzk=","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOACkMOM4W5PZG","tag_name":"v9.18.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"v9.18.2 (2026-09-07)","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-09-07T13:13:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T13:19:47Z","published_at":"2026-09-07T13:19:00Z","assets":[],"body":"### Fix\r\n\r\n- allow overwriting destination symlinks when `preserve_symlinks: false`\r\n- **cache**: resolve submodules from the current checkout's .gitmodules (#2767)\r\n\r\n### Security\r\n\r\n- prevent trust bypass via ambiguous URL characters\r\n\r\n    To prevent URL confusion attacks, trusted prefix matching is now restricted to repository URL paths containing only [RFC 3986 §2.3] \"unreserved\" characters (letters, digits, `-`, `.`, `_`, `~`) and `/`. URL paths containing other characters now require an exact, verbatim match.\r\n\r\n[RFC 3986 §2.3]: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3986#section-2.3"}
